    "source": "Previously retrieved primary manual retained with the original SKINIT qualification",
    "observations": [
      "IN/OUT use AL, AX or EAX and an imm8 or DX port selector in either code mode.",
      "RDMSR/WRMSR use ECX for the index and the complete EDX:EAX pair for the 64-bit value.",
      "Privilege and capability faults belong to the architectural instruction; this qualification checks native transport and controlled completion only."
    ]
